flowchart TD
    User[User invokes Reflow] --> CLI[Global CLI]
    CLI -->|--repository or --repository-url| Resolver[Repository resolver]
    Config[.config/reflow/config.toml] -->|repository.path or repository.url| Resolver
    Resolver --> Target[Validated RepositoryTarget]

    Target --> Kind{Target kind}
    Kind -->|Local| Local[Existing checkout]
    Kind -->|Remote| Clone[Temporary git clone]
    Clone --> Cleanup[Guaranteed cleanup]
    Local --> Materialized[Materialized local path]
    Clone --> Materialized

    Materialized --> Git[Git executor cwd]
    Materialized --> GH[GitHub CLI cwd]
    Materialized --> Docker[Docker source repository]
    Kind -->|Local only| Init[Initialization root]
    Kind -->|Remote rejected| InitError[Clear configuration error]

    Git --> Convert[Convert local tags]
    Git --> Recover[Recover missing releases]
    Git --> Snapshot[Temporary tagged worktree]
    GH --> Recover
    Snapshot --> Docker
    Docker --> Registry[GHCR / GitLab Registry]
